.TH "ctags-lang-lisp" "7" "" "6.2.0" "Universal Ctags"
.SH Name
ctags-lang-lisp \- Random notes about tagging Lisp source code with Universal Ctags
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
\fBctags\fP ... \-\-languages=+Lisp ...
\fBctags\fP ... \-\-language\-force=Lisp ...
\fBctags\fP ... \-\-map\-Lisp=+.cl ...
\fBctags\fP ... \-\-map\-Lisp=+.clisp ...
\fBctags\fP ... \-\-map\-Lisp=+.l ...
\fBctags\fP ... \-\-map\-Lisp=+.lisp ...
\fBctags\fP ... \-\-map\-Lisp=+.lsp ...
.fi
.sp
.SH DESCRIPTION
.sp
This man page gathers random notes about tagging Lisp source code.
